      `[n-1, n-2, ..., 0]`.  Negative indices from `-n` to `-1` are supported.
    keep_dims: An optional `bool`. Defaults to `False`.
      If `True`, retain reduced dimensions with length `1`.
    separator: An optional `string`. Defaults to `""`.
